title: $:/plugins/rimir/diffsync/changelog
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

|!Version |!Date |!Changes |
|v0.1.7 |2026-05-17 |Test coverage push: 1 new spec — `op=apply` is a clean no-op when the target tiddler is missing (user deleted it between compare and apply). Plugin coverage stays at ~85% lines; remaining residuals are `auto-refresh.js` (entire startup module is Tier D — needs a running wiki) and `action-diffsync.js`'s apply/revert branches that need the existing wiki-test fixtures extended. Both deferred to a Tier C/D follow-up. |
|v0.1.6 |2026-04-27 |Declare `doc-template` as soft-dependent in plugin.info |
|v0.1.5 |2026-04-25 |TW 5.4.0 compat: migrate to the new `diff-match-patch` flat function exports (`diffMain`, `diffLinesToChars`, `diffCharsToLines`); the class constructor was removed |
|v0.1.4 |2026-03-27 |Fix incorrect apply-to-source description in reference docs |
|v0.1.3 |2026-03-27 |Fix changelog version prefix, clarify restart rules for plugin shadow tiddlers |
|v0.1.2 |2026-03-26 |Add Jasmine tests for getContextLines, Playwright tests for review mode and auto-refresh |
|v0.1.1 |2026-03-26 |Review mode with accept/skip per change, auto-refresh on tiddler changes, one hunk per change, refactored shared config helper |
|v0.1.0 |2026-03-25 |Initial release: field-level comparison, line-based hunks, per-hunk selective sync, bidirectional apply, panel UI |
